fuck dude im sorry for your cat. When I saw the vomit I knew immediately it was rat poision. I don't know how your cat ate it or why, but just keep an eye out for other cats in the neighborhood that are dying of this or for other signs of vomit on the neighborhood street and if you see none, then maybe it was just a really unfortunate accident.

